						<r3d:remarks>GitHub: https://github.com/orgs/ecrin-github/repositories The MDR system was initially designed and developed in the context of the H2020 eXtreme - DataCloud(XDC) project, funded by the EU under grant agreement 777367. The next stage of development of the MDR is taking place within the H2020 EOSC-Life project, under EU grant agreement grant 824087, and is being largely carried out by ECRIN. The intention is to integrate that portal with the European Open Science Cloud&#039;s EOSC-hub services.</r3d:remarks>
